> Inspect the actual resized fitting inputs

These are the first40 fitting rows in their stored order, after native resize.
They supply real critic inputs; labels never enter either generator. The tiny
8x8 target resolution itself limits recognizable detail. All source galleries
below enlarge each pixel8 times with nearest sampling, four-pixel gray gaps and
no outer padding. No sharpening or selective sample filtering is applied.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/style_inputs.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
